{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330930/extras/7cb83ec578204b8567196997b2ac183b.avif?t=1769978692\" width=1513 height=355 /></span>Nocturnal Quest is a Semi-Idle RPG game. Players recruit heroes, kill monsters, craft weapons &amp; armor, advance talent trees, enchant/reforge equipment, discover mysterious gems, and finally assemble the most powerful adventure teams!<br><br><strong>Please note: Idle play is one of the main components of this game.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A semi-idle game with deep and complex itemization systems to support endless character builds!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 6 adventurer classes to choose from. Every class has 2 specializations, with 3 spells each.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-Based + Real-Time battle system: During battles, each unit takes its turn according to its initiative stat. However, triggered effects, buff/debuff ticks, and regeneration happen in &quot;real time&quot;. This unique system allows for deep strategy.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are more than 100 different active and passive skills to experiment with.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enchant, Reforge, and Transfer systems allow high customization of adventurers\u2019 equipment.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep gem system and a variety of set bonuses to further expand your strategy.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 20 types of monsters among 6 different maps.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attract residents and conduct explorations to further expand your town!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create unique builds and fight!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330930/extras/dd38d6e3c555d32f76e07d281e6a37da.poster.avif?t=1769978692\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330930/extras/dd38d6e3c555d32f76e07d281e6a37da.webm?t=1769978692\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330930/extras/dd38d6e3c555d32f76e07d281e6a37da.mp4?t=1769978692\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow magical fruits at the Botanist!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330930/extras/7f89846476be50e6f5dad42802a936c1.avif?t=1769978692\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330930/extras_big/7f89846476be50e6f5dad42802a936c1.webp?t=1769978692 width=1560 height=874 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Brew magical potions at the Alchemist!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330930/extras/30588a22d6430a1a00720b57edf4b51b.avif?t=1769978692\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2330930/extras_big/30588a22d6430a1a00720b57edf4b51b.webp?t=1769978692 width=1560 height=910 /></span></h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Slayer (10)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2330930/6d0c4133124577fcc166ebeab3bd6f967a2cd8c5.jpg"},{"name":"Slayer (100)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2330930/6d0c4133124577fcc166ebeab3bd6f967a2cd8c5.jpg"},{"name":"Slayer (500)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/app